  "title": "Nigeria becomes independent",
  "summary": "Nigeria became independent from Britain on 1 October 1960, with the Union Flag lowered and the green-white-green flag raised at midnight at the Race Course in Lagos. Princess Alexandra represented the Queen, and Abubakar Tafawa Balewa took the oath as Prime Minister. The Queen remained ceremonial head of state; Nnamdi Azikiwe became governor-general on 16 November 1960.",
